--------------------------------
AMSGrad优化器CUDA实现（函数声明）
来源: aten/src/ATen/native/cuda/fused_adam_amsgrad_impl.cuh
--------------------------------

【函数】
    _fused_adam_amsgrad_cuda_impl_(
        params: TensorList,
        grads: TensorList,
        exp_avgs: TensorList,
        exp_avg_sqs: TensorList,
        max_exp_avg_sqs: TensorList,
        state_steps: TensorList,
        lr: double,
        beta1: double,
        beta2: double,
        weight_decay: double,
        eps: double,
        maximize: bool,
        grad_scale: Optional[Tensor],
        found_inf: Optional[Tensor]
    )
        参数: lr=标量学习率
        用途: 融合的AMSGrad优化器更新，支持混合精度训练

    _fused_adam_amsgrad_cuda_impl_(
        params: TensorList,
        grads: TensorList,
        exp_avgs: TensorList,
        exp_avg_sqs: TensorList,
        max_exp_avg_sqs: TensorList,
        state_steps: TensorList,
        lr: Tensor,
        beta1: double,
        beta2: double,
        weight_decay: double,
        eps: double,
        maximize: bool,
        grad_scale: Optional[Tensor],
        found_inf: Optional[Tensor]
    )
        参数: lr=张量形式的学习率（支持per-parameter学习率）
        用途: 融合的AMSGrad优化器更新，支持张量学习率

【备注】
    - AMSGrad是Adam的变体，使用max_exp_avg_sq维护历史最大二阶矩估计
    - 两个重载仅学习率类型不同（标量 vs 张量）
    - grad_scale/found_inf用于混合精度训练的梯度缩放
